        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "The school is open again. Half the kids, twice the noise.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Somebody planted tomatoes in the median. I respect it.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "My neighbor trades eggs for news and the news is always bad.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The clinic line was short today. That is the best news I have had all week.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "If the power holds till Friday I am calling it a miracle and baking for it.",
